msgid "Contributor"
msgstr "貢獻者"

msgid "An entity responsible for making contributions to the resource. Examples of a Contributor include a person, an organization, or a service. Typically, the name of a Contributor should be used to indicate the entity."
msgstr "負責提供資源貢獻的實體。貢獻者範例包括人員、組織或服務。一般而言，貢獻者的名稱應該用來指出實體。"

msgid "Coverage"
msgstr "涵蓋面"

msgid "The spatial or temporal topic of the resource, the spatial applicability of the resource, or the jurisdiction under which the resource is relevant. Spatial topic and spatial applicability may be a named place or a location specified by its geographic coordinates. Temporal topic may be a named period, date, or date range. A jurisdiction may be a named administrative entity or a geographic place to which the resource applies. Recommended best practice is to use a controlled vocabulary such as the Thesaurus of Geographic Names [TGN]. Where appropriate, named places or time periods can be used in preference to numeric identifiers such as sets of coordinates or date ranges."
msgstr "資源的空間或時間主題、資源的空間適用性，或是資源的相關適用範圍。空間主題及空間適用性可能是已指定的位置，或是依其地理座標指定的位置。時間主題可能是指定的期間、日期或日期範圍。適用範圍可能是指定的管理實體或資源適用的地理位置。建議的最佳作法是使用受管制的詞彙，例如「地名辭彙集」[TGN]。適當時，優先使用指定的位置或時段，而不是數值 ID，例如座標集或日期範圍。"

msgid "Creator"
msgstr "建立者"

msgid "An entity primarily responsible for making the resource. Examples of a Creator include a person, an organization, or a service. Typically, the name of a Creator should be used to indicate the entity."
msgstr "主要負責提供資源的實體。建立者範例包括人員、組織或服務。一般而言，建立者的名稱應該用來指出實體。"

msgid "Date"
msgstr "日期"

msgid "A point or period of time associated with an event in the lifecycle of the resource. Date may be used to express temporal information at any level of granularity.  Recommended best practice is to use an encoding scheme, such as the W3CDTF profile of ISO 8601 [W3CDTF]."
msgstr "在資源的生命週期中，與事件相關聯的時間點或時段。日期可用來以任何層次的精度表示時間資訊。建議的最佳作法是使用一種編碼方法，例如 ISO 8601 的 W3CDTF 設定檔 [W3CDTF]。"

msgid "An account of the resource. Description may include but is not limited to: an abstract, a table of contents, a graphical representation, or a free-text account of the resource."
msgstr "資源的帳戶。說明可能包括但不限於：摘要、目錄、圖形表示法或資源的任意文字帳戶。"

msgid "Format"
msgstr "格式"

msgid "The file format, physical medium, or dimensions of the resource. Examples of dimensions include size and duration. Recommended best practice is to use a controlled vocabulary such as the list of Internet Media Types [MIME]."
msgstr "資源的檔案格式、實體媒體或維度。維度的範例包括大小及持續時間。建議的最佳作法是使用受管制的詞彙，例如「網際網路媒體類型」[MIME] 的清單。"

msgid "Identifier"
msgstr "識別碼"

msgid "An unambiguous reference to the resource within a given context. Recommended best practice is to identify the resource by means of a string conforming to a formal identification system."
msgstr "對給定環境定義內資源的明確參照。建議的最佳作法是透過符合正式識別系統字串的方式來識別資源。"

msgid "Language"
msgstr "語言"

msgid "A language of the resource. Recommended best practice is to use a controlled vocabulary such as RFC 4646 [RFC4646]."
msgstr "資源的語言。建議的最佳作法是使用受管制的詞彙，例如 RFC 4646 [RFC4646]。"

msgid "Publisher"
msgstr "發佈者"

msgid "An entity responsible for making the resource available. Examples of a Publisher include a person, an organization, or a service. Typically, the name of a Publisher should be used to indicate the entity."
msgstr "負責提供資源的實體。發佈者範例包括人員、組織或服務。一般而言，發佈者的名稱應該用來指出實體。"

msgid "Relation"
msgstr "關係"

msgid "A related resource. Recommended best practice is to identify the related resource by means of a string conforming to a formal identification system."
msgstr "相關資源。建議的最佳作法是透過符合正式識別系統字串的方式來識別相關的資源。"

msgid "Information about rights held in and over the resource. Typically, rights information includes a statement about various property rights associated with the resource, including intellectual property rights."
msgstr "資源所保留之權限的相關資訊。一般而言，權限資訊包括與資源相關聯的各種財產權（包括智慧財產權）的聲明。"

msgid "Source"
msgstr "來源"

msgid "A related resource from which the described resource is derived. The described resource may be derived from the related resource in whole or in part. Recommended best practice is to identify the related resource by means of a string conforming to a formal identification system."
msgstr "相關資源，從中衍生所說明的資源。說明的資源可能完全或部分衍生自相關資源。建議的最佳作法是透過符合正式識別系統字串的方式來識別相關的資源。"

msgid "Subject"
msgstr "標題"

msgid "The topic of the resource. Typically, the subject will be represented using keywords, key phrases, or classification codes. Recommended best practice is to use a controlled vocabulary. To describe the spatial or temporal topic of the resource, use the Coverage element."
msgstr "資源的主題。一般而言，主旨會使用關鍵字、關鍵詞組或分類代碼來代表。建議的最佳作法是使用受管制的詞彙。若要說明資源的空間或時間主題，請使用涵蓋面元素。"

msgid "Title"
msgstr "標題"

msgid "The name given to the resource."
msgstr "資源的指定名稱。"

msgid "The nature or genre of the resource. Recommended best practice is to use a controlled vocabulary such as the DCMI Type Vocabulary [DCMITYPE]. To describe the file format, physical medium, or dimensions of the resource, use the Format element."
msgstr "資源的本質或型態。建議的最佳作法是使用受管制的詞彙，例如「DCMI 類型詞彙」[DCMITYPE]。若要說明資源的檔案格式、實體媒體或維度，請使用「格式」元素。"

msgid "Provides forty additional meta tags from the <a href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>."
msgstr "提供來自 <a href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a> 的 40 個其他 meta 標籤。"

