msgid "Mask icon color"
msgstr "遮罩圖示顏色"

msgid "Color attribute for SVG (mask) icon in hexadecimal format, e.g. '#0000ff'. Setting it will break HTML validation. If not set macOS Safari ignores the Mask Icon entirely, making the Icon: SVG completely useless."
msgstr "十六進位格式 SVG（遮罩）圖示的顏色屬性，例如 '#0000ff'。 設定它將岔斷 HTML 驗證。 如果未設定 macOS Safari，則會完全忽略「遮罩圖示」，讓「圖示：SVG」完全無用。"

msgid "Mask icon (SVG)"
msgstr "遮罩圖示 (SVG)"

msgid "A grayscale scalable vector graphic (SVG) file."
msgstr "灰階可調式向量圖形 (SVG) 檔案。"

msgid "Default icon"
msgstr "預設圖示"

msgid "The traditional favicon, must be either a GIF, ICO, JPG/JPEG or PNG image."
msgstr "傳統的 Favicon 必須是 GIF、ICO、JPG/JPEG 或 PNG 影像。"

msgid "Provides support for meta tags used for Google Custom Search Engine."
msgstr "提供對用於「Google 自訂搜尋引擎」的 meta 標籤的支援。"

msgid "Metatag: Google Custom Search Engine (CSE)"
msgstr "meta 標籤：Google 自訂搜尋引擎 (CSE)"

