msgstr "不顯示 Pinterest 瀏覽器延伸產生的浮動「儲存」或「搜尋」按鈕。"

msgid "No pin"
msgstr "不固定"

msgid "Do not pin anything from this page. When selected, this option will take precedence over all options below."
msgstr "不固定此頁面中的任何內容。如果已選取，此選項將優先於下面的所有選項。"

msgid "No search"
msgstr "不搜尋"

