msgid "Use tokens to avoid redundant meta data and search engine penalization. For example, a 'keyword' value of \"example\" will be shown on all content using this configuration, whereas using the [node:field_keywords] automatically inserts the \"keywords\" values from the current entity (node, term, etc)."
msgstr "使用記號來避免多餘的 meta 資料及搜尋引擎懲罰。例如，\"example\" 的 'keyword' 值將會顯示在所有使用此配置的內容上，而使用 [node:field_keywords] 會自動插入來自現行實體（節點、術語等）的 \"keywords\" 值。"

msgid "To use tokens to image fields, the image field on that entity bundle (content type, term, etc) must have the \"Token\" display settings enabled, the image field must not be hidden, and it must be set to output as an image, e.g. using the \"Thumbnail\" field formatter. It is also recommended to use an appropriate image style that resizes the image rather than output the original image; see individual meta tag descriptions for size recommendations."
msgstr "若要在影像欄位中使用記號，該實體組合（內容類型、術語等）上的影像欄位必須已啟用「記號」顯示設定、影像欄位不得隱藏，且必須設成輸出為影像，例如使用「縮圖」欄位格式製作程式。我們也建議您使用適當的影像樣式來調整影像大小而非輸出原始影像；請參閱個別 meta 標籤說明以取得大小建議。"

